        },
        {
          "text": "Bawandaayase, ese mwikoonjelela enywe, murekeeresie mu khwifwiilisia burume bwe khumuraamo kimiooyo buno; sikila ebarwa niyo ese muandikile yino seli endeeyi lukali tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
