          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenya mumanye muli wandaayefwe Timoteo alekhuulibwe khukhwama mu siboe. Aaba ne aleecha khangu, aba khabe naye nga khamukeniie enywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.23",
